  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed change of use would not harm neighbours' living conditions and would not harm the appearance of the building or street scene and, and would comply with the Council's parking standards. The proposal accords with policies ENV-B.1.1 New Development, C.3.3 Changes of Use of Health Facilities, H.7.1 Supported Housing and T.1.4 Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing Facilities for Developments, of the Adopted Unitary Development Plan.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is occupied.",
    "Condition : 4 - Details of ventilation equipment to serve the proposed cooking facilities shall be submitted to and approved by the local planning authority before the use commences and shall be inplemented as approved, indicating details of sound attenuation measures, before the use commences.",
    "Condition : 5 - The use hereby permitted shall not be begun until details of the arrangements for storing of refuse or waste (including medical waste) have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. The arrangements for storing of refuse or waste shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the use commences."
  ],
